I am using matrix sdk to build chat app, I could not receive any push notification
I have used the following code

```
fun addPushNotification(context: Context, token: String?) {

        val pushCallback = object : ApiCallback<Void> {
            override fun onSuccess(info: Void?) {

                try {
                    (context as BaseActivity<*, *>).showToasty(
                        ToastyType.SUCCESS,
                        "registerToThirdPartyServer succeeded"
                    )

                } catch (e: Exception) {
                    (context as BaseActivity<*, *>).showToasty(ToastyType.ERROR, "registerToThirdPartyServer failed")

                }
            }

            override fun onUnexpectedError(e: Exception?) {
                e?.let {
                    it.message?.let {
                        (context as BaseActivity<*, *>).showToasty(ToastyType.ERROR, it)
                    }
                }
            }

            override fun onMatrixError(e: MatrixError?) {
                e?.let {
                    it.message?.let {
                        (context as BaseActivity<*, *>).showToasty(ToastyType.ERROR, it)
                    }
                }
            }

            override fun onNetworkError(e: Exception?) {

                e?.let {
                    it.message?.let {
                        (context as BaseActivity<*, *>).showToasty(ToastyType.ERROR, it)
                    }
                }
            }
        }


        var session = getSession(context)
        session.pushersRestClient.addHttpPusher(
            token, "im.vector.app.android", computePushTag(session),
            "en", "myapp", "ay 7aga", "https://mylink/_matrix/push/v1/notify",
            true, true, pushCallback
        )
    }
```

I do not know where is the wrong part , is there anything I should add in server to allow push notification

when I try to chat from android to riot web browser I receive notification, but when try to chat from riot to my android app I did not receive anything

please anyone can help me, I have been in this for so long time
